<item>
            <title>[MAHOUT-762] VectorDumper fails to parse --help option</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/MAHOUT-762</link>
                <project id="12310751" key="MAHOUT">Mahout</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In VectorDumper.java, the Group Builder does not add help as a command line argument. This raises an exception when the user tries &quot;bin/mahout vectordump --help.&quot;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="12514080">MAHOUT-762</key>
            <summary>VectorDumper fails to parse --help option</summary>
